  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of a circle is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>Im</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;A line which passes through the centre of the given circle and the vertex of the parabola,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-intercept equal to _________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>Im</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p>Equation of circle is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Centre:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Parabola :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Vertex :&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Equation of line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;intercept&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
